WEBVTT

00:13.980 --> 00:18.644
He's not angry, he's overwhelmed

00:21.146 --> 00:29.328
I see the signs, I know this pain The static

00:29.428 --> 00:36.092
flooding in Your brain, it's not a choice It's

00:36.152 --> 00:41.175
not a fight, it's not a flaw It's just the world

00:41.475 --> 00:42.936
and all it's wrong

00:58.556 --> 01:05.881
It's okay, you're safe Focus on my voice This

01:06.001 --> 01:12.465
isn't a trap, you have a choice Just breathe

01:14.886 --> 01:20.109
Aubrey, my name is Aubrey Is it okay if I put my

01:20.149 --> 01:21.030
hand on your shoulder?

01:23.752 --> 01:27.234
Is it okay if I hug you?

01:37.874 --> 01:46.301
I, I, I know you're not

02:06.738 --> 02:10.660
The storm is past, you're safe, you're

02:14.001 --> 02:20.204
all The first unconditional, the first real hug

02:21.885 --> 02:22.686
You're safe

02:26.948 --> 02:27.688
You're safe

02:35.512 --> 02:36.252
You're safe

